      "description": "<p>The Sickened condition from concentrated xulgath bile doesn't improve on its own until the target recovers from the poison. A target who recovers from concentrated xulgath bile is immune to being sickened by this poison for 1 minute</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> DC 22 Fortitude Saving Throw</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> 1d10 Poison Damage damage and Sickened 1 (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> 2d10 Poison Damage damage and Sickened 2 (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> 2d10 Poison Damage damage and Sickened 3 (1 round)</p>",
